{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》現正熱播，陳自瑤（Yoyo）連日來為劇中飾演的昔日影后「關子盈」落力造勢。她日前以一襲極致性感的純白高衩晚裝現身首播宣傳活動，大騷白滑修長美腿，逆齡狀態成為焦點。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤為《玫瑰戰爭》落力宣傳。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197931006716809216039542.jpeg/4fLf7oL-eiHSHI1irV473vjw2ngZr612hUVek4VFXpM\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤為《玫瑰戰爭》落力宣傳。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身穿低胸超高衩白裙。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197931003935854592736120.jpeg/g0O4qlOmpzC0I3Ve1NyzcaBSBDs2cKaZTGlHpkxpR6Y\"/><figcaption>身穿低胸超高衩白裙。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>高衩白裙大騷逆天長腿</p><p>陳自瑤身穿低胸抹胸緞面長裙，大騷誘人鎖骨與優美肩頸線條。最搶眼的莫過於裙襬的超高開衩設計，無論她坐在舞台邊緣，還是在觀眾席階梯上側身擺姿勢，一雙「逆天長腿」皆表露無遺；配搭閃亮銀色幼帶高跟涼鞋與復古紅唇，散發濃郁女人味，視覺效果相當震撼。</p><figure><img alt=\"大騷長腿。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930999510601728864301.jpeg/_fdPB0wjaf9WN28WNkFJkco6Z7VasbyWZWEKMGVhCjA\"/><figcaption>大騷長腿。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大派性感福利。（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930997237157888581794.jpeg/nxJ7270LHAMKSzTp7aGTqB-BPpIYYpVzbxTuh28U7oc\"/><figcaption>大派性感福利。（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>45歲凍齡狀態大勇</p><p>現年45歲的陳自瑤向來保養得宜，即使在近距離鏡頭下，緊緻透亮的肌膚與零贅肉身段依然經得起考驗，獲不少網民大讚凍齡有術。在公開的造型照中，她對著鏡頭時而展露甜美微笑，時而輕撥秀髮流露嫵媚神態，舉手投足盡顯成熟韻味，狀態大勇。</p><figure><img alt=\"盡展極致女人味（IG@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197931001574330368768401.jpeg/DMqfnB-MFH0JEk7PQb74if3_rJOihmi1Dlnnpg5Z56Y\"/><figcaption>盡展極致女人味（IG@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.749291+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":469,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:59:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:02:00.100212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:54.359968+00:00","content_hash":"0ee264b1261613198e467ee9c643d7c03ebe829c1884c3fd668b4a526fe2c51b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}